A||N||7||bHooper||Flight of the Phoenix!!||||1||
Z||000000||bHooper||05-09-2000||10:00 PM||||The fire consumes my (enduraflex)feathers and sears my flesh, reducing me to ashes.  After dying, I go into a hibernation that can last only six months, or can last for four years.     Whenever I rise from my ashes, I am always insane.  That's why some of history's greatest heroes have been sent to destroy me.  My rampages usually last for only a week, but that is often long enough to attract attention to myself.  Not this time, though.  I arose in a remote part of the world (greensboro, NC), and the <BR>destruction of my madness went largely unnoticed (fuel system, cradle, slave cylinder).  Contrary to the legends, I am not a gigantic creature, having a wingspan of only 20 feet (heroes tend to exaggerate their victories), so I'm not likely to be noticed by human technology (the media).  Finally, I am for once of sound mind, and quite able to think about what I am doing.  I have risen in a time where one who wields power well can go very far. I ought to do well in this modern world, for I _AM_ power.<P>And tonight from the ashes of abandonment... a <B>FIERO GT is reborn!!!!</B><P>Yes, the car cranked!  After 4 years, and a donated tranny the car cranked!!!!<P>YESSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!<P><BR>With only a few technical dificulties that I will ask about later tonight   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I <B>am</B> so happy!!!<p>[This message has been edited by bHooper (edited 05-09-2000).]||||reg||1
